      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Mountain Top became a rail hub when the Lehigh & Susquehanna and Lehigh Valley lines arrived, spawning neighborhoods such as Solomon's Gap and Penobscot around the tracks.",
